%% alt: Diagram for 4.4 Design a regulated document-review assistant: Upload contract, Ingest: extract text, keep layout and page refs, flag hidden text, Review calls: contract + playbook section, quote and classify
flowchart LR
  U[Upload contract] --> I[Ingest: extract text,<br/>keep layout and page refs,<br/>flag hidden text]
  I --> R[Review calls:<br/>contract + playbook section,<br/>quote and classify]
  R --> V[Code checks:<br/>quotes exist verbatim,<br/>redlines from library,<br/>schema valid]
  V -->|fail| R
  V --> X[Second-pass check on<br/>high-risk findings<br/>and 'standard' red lines]
  X --> W[Lawyer review UI:<br/>findings side by side<br/>with contract]
  W --> D[(Decisions, overrides,<br/>versions, audit trail)]
  D --> E[Eval set and<br/>playbook updates]
  P[(Playbook and<br/>approved fallbacks,<br/>versioned)] --> R
  P --> V
